      "title_2": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "jcr:title": "Altera® Agilex 3, 5, & 9 FPGAs and SoCs",
       "type": "h2",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
      },
      "title_3": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "jcr:title": "Agilex™ 3 FPGAs and SoCs",
       "type": "h4",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
      },
      "text_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "text": "<p>The Agilex® 3 FPGA is designed to deliver a blend of low power consumption, high performance, and small form factors, catering to various applications. This series stands out for its ease of use, making it an attractive option for designers familiar with Cyclone and MAX FPGAs. The Agilex 3 family includes B-Series and C-Series devices, each tailored for specific use cases. B-Series FPGAs are ideal for board-, platform-, and system-level management applications, such as power sequencing and system monitoring, whereas C-Series devices are designed to meet the broader and more demanding needs of industrial, medical, data center, and telecommunication applications. This range allows for versatile deployment in environments that require the latest in FPGA architecture, with a focus on AI capabilities in compact and power-efficient packages.</p>",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
       "textIsRich": "true"
      }
     },
