    "container_2": {
     "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
     "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
     "backgroundColor": "rgb(247,247,247)",
     "title_1": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:title": "Agilex™ 5 FPGAs and SoCs",
      "type": "h3",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
     },
     "text_1": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "text": "<p>Altera Agilex 5 FPGAs offer enhanced performance and power efficiency, featuring industry-first AI Tensor Blocks, Arm Cortex-A76/A55 cores, and second-gen Hyperflex FPGA Architecture. They provide up to 2.5X performance and 50% lower power compared to Cyclone V FPGAs. With transceivers up to 28.1 Gbps, PCIe 4.0 x8, and DDR5 support, they cater to midrange FPGA applications in various markets like communication, video, industry, medical, data centers, and defense.</p><p style=\"margin-top:0\">&nbsp;</p>",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true"
     },
     "table_1": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "text": "<table cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"1\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr><th style=\"white-space:nowrap\">E-Series</th>\n<th style=\"white-space:nowrap\">D-Series</th>\n</tr><tr><td>Optimized for power and size for intelligent applications at the edge, embedded, and more</td>\n<td>Optimized for performance and power efficiency - ideal for various applications across multiple markets</td>\n</tr><tr><td>50K - 656K LEs</td>\n<td>103K - 644K LEs</td>\n</tr><tr><td>Package size as small as 15 mm x 15 mm</td>\n<td>Package size as small as 23 mm x 23 mm</td>\n</tr><tr><td>Up to 24 x 28G transceivers</td>\n<td>Up to 32 x 28G transceivers</td>\n</tr><tr><td>Up to PCIe 4.0 x4 and 10/25GbE x6 Hard IP</td>\n<td>Up to PCIe 4.0 x8 and 25GbE x16 Hard IP</td>\n</tr><tr><td>DDR4 @ 2,667 Mbps, DDR5 @ 3,600 Mbps, LPDDR4/5 @ 3,733 Mbps</td>\n<td>DDR4 @ 3,200 Mbps, DDR5 @ 4,000 Mbps, LPDDR4/4x/5 @ 4,267 Mbps, QDR IV @ 2,132 Mbps</td>\n</tr><tr><td>Peak TOPS INT8 up to 26</td>\n<td>Peak TOPS INT8 up to 56</td>\n</tr><tr><td>18x19 Multipliers up to 1,692</td>\n<td>18x19 Multipliers up to3,680</td>\n</tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\">Multi-core Arm processors of Dual-core A55 @ 1.5 GHz and Dual-core A76 @ 1.8GHz</td>\n</tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\">MIPI D-PHY v2.5 at up to 3.5 Gbps per lane</td>\n</tr></tbody></table>",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/table",
      "textIsRich": "true",
      "cq:styleIds": [
       "",
       "",
       "1722939215525"
      ]
     },
