    "container_4": {
     "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
     "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
     "backgroundColor": "rgb(247,247,247)",
     "title_1": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:title": "Agilex™ 9 FPGAs and SoCs",
      "type": "h3",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
     },
     "text_1": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "text": "<p>Altera Agilex Series 9 FPGAs embody a significant advancement in FPGA technology, combining cutting-edge 7nm process technology with a wealth of integrated features. With their versatile architecture, these FPGAs are engineered to excel across diverse applications, from data centers to networking and beyond. The fusion of high-performance processors, adaptable transceivers, and sophisticated processing capabilities results in a potent platform for addressing the challenges of modern computing and communication systems. This series empowers engineers with a tool to create highly optimized, power-efficient solutions, enabling innovation across a spectrum of industries.</p><p style=\"margin-top:0\">&nbsp;</p>",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true"
     },
     "table_1": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "text": "<table cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"1\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr><th>&nbsp;</th>\n<th>Direct RF-Series SoC FPGA<br>\nAGRW014</th>\n<th>Direct RF-Series SoC FPGA<br>\nAGRW027</th>\n<th>Direct RF-Series SoC FPGA<br>\nAGRM027</th>\n</tr><tr><td><b>Logic Elements (kLE)</b></td>\n<td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">1437</td>\n<td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">2693</td>\n<td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">2693</td>\n</tr><tr><td><b>18x19 Multipliers</b></td>\n<td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">9020</td>\n<td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">17056</td>\n<td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">17056</td>\n</tr><tr><td><b># of ADC/DAC</b></td>\n<td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">4/4</td>\n<td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">8/8</td>\n<td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">20/16</td>\n</tr><tr><td><b>Sample Rate (Gsps)</b></td>\n<td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">64/64</td>\n<td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">64/64</td>\n<td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">4/12</td>\n</tr><tr><td><b># of Bits Resolution</b></td>\n<td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">10/10</td>\n<td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">10/10</td>\n<td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">14/14</td>\n</tr><tr><td><b>Embedded Memory (Mb)</b></td>\n<td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">190</td>\n<td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">2878</td>\n<td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">287</td>\n</tr><tr><td><b>Quad Core ARM</b></td>\n<td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Yes</td>\n<td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Yes</td>\n<td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Yes</td>\n</tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>XCVR's</b></td>\n<td>58G PAM-4, 32G NRZ</td>\n<td>58G PAM-4, 32G NRZ</td>\n<td>58G PAM-4, 32G NRZ</td>\n</tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>PCIe</b></td>\n<td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">4.0</td>\n<td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">4.0</td>\n<td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">4.0</td>\n</tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Package</b></td>\n<td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">45x32</td>\n<td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">52.5x42.5</td>\n<td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">56.45</td>\n</tr></tbody></table>",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/table",
      "textIsRich": "true",
      "cq:styleIds": [
